'''An Elder Secret (Merciless)''' is the first stage in [[Growing Strange]]. Beating this stage allows the player to access one of seven random [[Continuation Stage]]s. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[Color of Blood (Merciless)]]
*[[Fear of Flying (Merciless)]]
*[[Hearts of Darkness (Merciless)]]
*[[Holy Wrath (Merciless)]]
*[[Galactic Threat (Merciless)]]
*[[Clash of Steel (Merciless)]]
*[[Seas of Death (Merciless)]]
Each is based around a different enemy type, with a 99% chance of yielding an [[Catfruit|Elder Catfruit Seed]] and a 1% chance of an Elder Catfruit (at least one reward is guaranteed).

