==Battleground==
*2 [[Mr. Angel]]s (200%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*1 [[Ginger Snache]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 22.67 seconds<sup>680f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Angel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns.
**4 [[Mr. Angel]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
