**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
**3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
