==Trivia==
*Prior to version 7.5, this stage contained a 400% [[Calamary]] instead of a 1,600% [[Maawth]].
*In the speech-bubble reference beside the event name, this level used to be labeled "Deadly" instead of "Merciless".
*This stage's gimmick is the opposite of the regular Catfruit stages. The first level is similar to [[Catfruit Jubilee]] with a variety of enemies, while the [[Continuation Stage|Continuations]] are similar to the other "Growing" stages, featuring enemies of one trait.
*The stage contains at least one enemy from every trait the continuation stages feature.

